Description: An RGB layer the compositor cannot import keeps its layer and is copied (ORDER 465, round 4)
 +stereo3d10 stopped promoting every picture whose modifier the compositor does not list, which also took a
 WebGL canvas (a 360 video, a WebXR session) out of its layer and with it its stereo declaration. Only decoded
 YUV pictures are drawn by WebRender instead of promoted; an RGB external layer stays and is copied to shared
 memory at commit, without making its wl_buffer (the import request). The pair is looked up in the tranches of
 the compositor's main device only (zwp_linux_dmabuf_feedback_v1: main_device, tranche_target_device).
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code
---
diff --git a/gfx/layers/NativeLayerWayland.cpp b/gfx/layers/NativeLayerWayland.cpp
